  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture, Mini Northern Plains has boundless flat grassland, and the wind path dao marks in that area are somewhat more numerous than elsewhere in the aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1066
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_mini_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earthly calamities such as the wind flowers and spring dawn jade orioles gave Fang Yuan wood path and wind path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "calamity-gained-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_earthly_calamity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong’s killer move unlimited wind expends ten thousand of his wind path dao marks. After that price, the wind is long lasting and can only be resisted by specific techniques.",
      "chapters": [
        1706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unlimited-wind-cost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In battle the same move is described again as expending ten thousand of his wind path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1726
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unlimited-wind-cost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya land spirit uses wind to intensify refinement fire, wind path dao marks contaminate the process. Only by purifying that wind can Immortal Gu refinement proceed smoothly.",
      "chapters": [
        1858
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-contamination",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fate war Wu Yong used unlimited wind and permanently expended wind path dao marks, so his foundation fell.",
      "chapters": [
        1997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-war-expenditure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "That permanent expenditure is remembered afterward as part of his contributions in the battle.",
      "chapters": [
        2067
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-war-expenditure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Western Desert’s fire path, earth path, and wind path dao marks are outstanding, and those three paths have the most resource points there.",
      "chapters": [
        2267
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
